{{!
    @template local_ai_reportcreator/create_panels

    Create-report page body: the request form on the left, and a progress
    panel + error panel on the right that amd/src/create.js drives live
    while the report is being generated.

    Classes required for JS: d-none, col-md-5, col-md-12 (toggled by
    amd/src/create.js).

    Data attributes required for JS: none — amd/src/create.js binds to the
    element ids below directly (#form-col, #progress-col, #form-container,
    #progress-panel, #progress-table, #error-panel, #error-message, and one
    row id per entry in "progressrows"). These ids must not change without
    updating amd/src/create.js to match. #form-col/#progress-col are the
    actual grid columns — amd/src/create.js hides/resizes those (not just
    their inner content) so the layout doesn't leave a blank reserved column
    once the form is hidden.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * apinotification - pre-rendered $OUTPUT->notification() HTML, or empty string when the API is configured
    * formhtml - pre-rendered moodleform HTML ($form->render())
    * generatinglabel - heading text for the progress panel
    * progressrows - array of {id, label} for each pipeline stage
    * errorheadinglabel - label prefix for the error panel

    Example context (json):
    {
        "apinotification": "",
        "formhtml": "<form>...</form>",
        "generatinglabel": "Calling AI middleware...",
        "progressrows": [
            {"id": "row-sql", "label": "SQL Agent"},
            {"id": "row-template", "label": "Template Agent"}
        ],
        "errorheadinglabel": "Error"
    }
}}
{{{apinotification}}}
<div class="row g-3 align-items-start">
    <div class="col-md-7" id="form-col">
        <div id="form-container">
            {{{formhtml}}}
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-5" id="progress-col">
        <div id="progress-panel" class="card mb-3 d-none">
            <div class="card-header fw-semibold">{{generatinglabel}}</div>
            <div class="card-body p-0">
                <table class="table table-sm mb-0" id="progress-table">
                    <tbody>
                        {{#progressrows}}
                        <tr id="{{id}}">
                            <td class="ps-3 py-2 w-50">{{label}}</td>
                            <td class="py-2">
                                <span class="status-badge">
                                    <span class="spinner-grow spinner-grow-sm text-secondary" role="status"></span>
                                </span>
                            </td>
                            <td class="py-2 text-end pe-3 text-muted small detail-cell"></td>
                        </tr>
                        {{/progressrows}}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="error-panel" class="alert alert-danger d-none" role="alert">
            <strong>{{errorheadinglabel}}:</strong>
            <span id="error-message"></span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
